      "writtenOn": "2026-03-20T08:21:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To prevent interference during Flash operations, it is a safer practice to acquire a lock beforehand. You can refer to crec_flash_lock_mapped_storage; however, please note that it is only implemented when CONFIG_EXTERNAL_STORAGE is enabled.",
